  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nFree shipping on orders $35+ 🚀\n\nCart\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n5\n\nOMSOM\n\nMala Salad Starter 3-pack\nRegular price\n$12.00 CAD\nQuantity\nDecrease quantity for Mala Salad Starter 3-pack\nIncrease quantity for Mala Salad Starter 3-pack\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Omsom.\n\n麻辣凉菜: a bold, savory salad with a tingly Sichuan kick.\n\nFire up Chinese Mala Salad with everything from chicken + cucumbers to mushrooms in under 20 minutes!\n\nIngredients\nNutritional info\nShipping\nShare\nInside a meal starter\n\nHard-to-get ingredients, but we got them. No substitutes, no swaps, just proud, loud Asian flavors without cultural compromise. \n\nWe go the distance so you don't have to - sampling from 15+ suppliers for a single ingredient and importing high-quality ingredients directly from Asia.\n\nOur promise\nCook restaurant-quality Asian dishes in under 30 minutes with our meal starters.\nRecipes to get you fired up 🌶\nKrapow Shrimp Rice Paper Wraps\nDECEMBER 15, 2021\n\nSpicy, salty and oh-so-flavorful, these shrimp rice paper wraps make the perfect lil' snack.\n\n11 comments\nVeggie Rice Paper Dumplings\nDECEMBER 15, 2021\n\nServe these flavor bombs on their own as an appetizer, or as a meal with your favorite grains!\n\n16 comments\nGround Meat Krapow\nDECEMBER 2, 2021\n\nFire up this beloved Teigen fam recipe for chili basil stir-fry in under 20 minutes.\n\n7 comments\n1\n/\nof\n3\nSpice up your inbox\n\nSign up for our newsletter to get exclusive recipes, cooking tips, and more.\n\nEmail\nQuick links\nShop all\nMeet us\nRecipes\nContact\nOur mission\n\nTo bring proud, loud Asian flavors to your fingertips any day of the week.\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nPinterest\nInstagram\nTikTok\nCountry/region\nCanada (CAD $)\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-crave-demo Powered by Shopify"
}